<p>Indian soybean meal pricing tracks the domestic soybean crush margin, the global soy complex, and how competitive Indian meal is against South American origins in any given month — export volumes fall sharply in years when Indian meal prices out of the market. Send your protein specification, quantity, packing preference and destination port for a current quote.</p>

